  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A senior unsecured loan of up to &#x20ac; 3 million under the Sustainable Reboot SME  Programme (&quot;the Programme&quot;).  The proceeds of the Bank&apos;s investment will be used to provide leases to help  finance the investments in micro, small and medium-sized enterprises in Bosnia  and Herzegovina assisting in improving the competitiveness and compliance with  technical standards in line with the EU directives and other international  recognized standards.</narrative>
